Package: sdtmai
Type: Package
Title: Minimal AI-Assisted SDTM Mapping Proof of Concept
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("ClinicalAI", "SDTM POC Team", email = "noreply@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates a draft, programmer-reviewable SDTM Demographics mapping
    from approved study metadata, local SDTMIG metadata, and selected study
    context using an OpenAI-compatible endpoint. This package is an exploratory
    proof of concept and does not generate SDTM datasets or transformation code.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    haven,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    officer,
    readr,
    readxl,
    yaml
